[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.020]   Ladies and gentlemen, thank you for standing by
[00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:08.960]   and welcome to Constellium's second quarter 2020 results call.
[00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:12.180]   At this time, all participants are in a listen-only mode.
[00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:15.160]   Later, we will conduct a question and answer session
