[00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:20.360]   If anyone should require assistance during the conference,
[00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:23.620]   please press star zero on your touchtone telephone.
[00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:26.880]   As a reminder, this conference call may be recorded.
[00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:30.240]   I would now like to turn the conference over to your host today,
[00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:33.860]   Mr. Ryan Ventling, Director of Investor Relations.
[00:00:33.860 --> 00:00:35.280]   Sir, please go ahead.
[00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:37.360]   Thank you, Operator.
