[00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:54.460]   A copy of the slide presentation for today's call
[00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:56.940]   is available on our website at constellium.com
[00:00:56.940 --> 00:00:59.060]   and today's call is being recorded.
[00:00:59.060 --> 00:01:02.320]   Before we begin, I'd like to encourage everyone
[00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:05.660]   to visit the company's website and take a look at our recent filings.
