[00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:09.000]   Ladies and gentlemen, thank you for standing by, and welcome to the Aldera Therapeutics Second Quarter 2020 Financial Results Conference Call.
[00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.420]   At this time, all participants are in a listen-only mode.
[00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:16.180]   After the speaker's remarks, there will be a question and answer session.
[00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:20.820]   To ask a question during the session, you will need to press star 1 on your telephone.
[00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:23.940]   If you would like to withdraw your question, press the pound key.
[00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:27.200]   Please be advised that today's conference is being recorded.
[00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:30.780]   If you require further assistance, please press star 0.
[00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:36.660]   I would now like to introduce the company's Chief Financial Officer, Mr. Joshua Reedy.
[00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:38.200]   Thank you. You may begin.
[00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:41.540]   Thank you, and good morning, everyone.
[00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:46.780]   On the call with me are Dr. Todd Brady, Aldera's President and Chief Executive Officer,
[00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:49.740]   and David McMullen, our Chief Commercial Officer.
[00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:55.820]   Dr. Brady will begin with an overview of our recent highlights and upcoming clinical milestones.
[00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:57.580]   I will discuss our...
[00:00:57.760 --> 00:01:00.980]   ...second quarter financial results, and then we'll take your questions.
[00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:07.340]   Please note that this morning's conference call contains forward-looking statements regarding future events
[00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:09.540]   and the future performance of Aldera.
[00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:15.640]   Forward-looking statements include statements regarding the timing of planned clinical trial initiations,
[00:01:15.640 --> 00:01:21.940]   Aldera's possible or assumed future results of operations, expenses, and financial position,
[00:01:21.940 --> 00:01:27.420]   business strategies and plans, research, development, and commercial plans,
[00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:33.740]   or expectations, trends, market sizing, competitive position, industry environment,
[00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:36.640]   and potential growth opportunities, among other things.
[00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:41.380]   These statements are based upon the information available to the company today.
[00:01:41.380 --> 00:01:49.160]   As a result of the COVID-19 pandemic, clinical site availability, staffing, and patient recruitment
[00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:54.640]   have been negatively affected, and the timelines to complete our clinical trials may be delayed.
[00:01:55.760 --> 00:02:00.360]   Aldera assumes no obligation to update these statements as circumstances change.
[00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:07.740]   Future events and actual results could differ materially from those projected in the company's forward-looking statements,
[00:02:07.740 --> 00:02:13.460]   including the current and potential future impact of the COVID-19 pandemic on our business,
