[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.280]   Ladies and gentlemen, thank you for standing by and welcome to the SAG 3rd Quarter 2020 Earnings Conference Call.
[00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:11.440]   At this time, all participants are in a listen-only mode.
